---
import '@fontsource/anton/latin.css';
import '@fontsource-variable/archivo';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="it">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Trovatemi aiuta le attività locali a trasformare clienti soddisfatti, recensioni e passaparola in fiducia, visibilità e scelta." />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#111318" />
    <title>Trovatemi.it ★ — Fiducia. Visibilità. Scelta.</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="topbar">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/master-home" aria-label="Trovatemi.it">
        TROVATEM<span class="wordmark-i">I<span class="star">★</span></span>.IT
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="Navigazione principale">
        <a href="#come-funziona">Come funziona</a>
        <a href="#prezzo">€149/mese</a>
        <a class="nav-cta" href="/">Beauty Check ↗</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero shell">
        <p class="kicker">PER ATTIVITÀ LOCALI CHE LAVORANO BENE</p>
        <h1>Hai già clienti felici.<br /><em>Fai in modo che si veda.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">
          Recensioni. Risposte. Contenuti. Presenza locale.<br />
          Una sola macchina per non lasciare il passaparola morire alla cassa.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="#come-funziona">Guarda come funziona ↓</a>
          <a class="button button-ghost" href="/">Beauty &amp; Wellness? Fai il Beauty Check ↗</a>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-strip" aria-label="Offerta Trovatemi">
          <span>21 giorni</span><b>€0 oggi</b><span>poi €149/mese</span><span>una sede</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="truth-section">
        <div class="shell truth-grid">
          <div>
            <p class="kicker kicker-light">LA SCENA CHE SUCCEDE OGNI GIORNO</p>
            <h2>“Mi sono trovata benissimo.”</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="truth-story">
            <p>Tu sorridi.</p>
            <p>Dici grazie.</p>
            <p>Lei paga.</p>
            <p>Esce.</p>
            <strong>Fine.</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="truth-punch">
            <p>Google non lo sa.</p>
            <p>La prossima cliente non lo sa.</p>
            <p>Quella che ti sta confrontando con altri tre non lo sa.</p>
            <strong>Lo sapete in due. Tu e lei. 😂</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="come-funziona" class="pillars shell">
        <header class="section-head">
          <p class="kicker">TROVATEMI FA TRE COSE</p>
          <h2>Prima si fidano.<br />Poi ti trovano.<br /><em>Poi scelgono te.</em></h2>
        </header>

        <article class="pillar pillar-yellow">
          <div class="pillar-number">01</div>
          <div class="pillar-copy">
            <p class="kicker">FIDUCIA</p>
            <h3>Costruisci fiducia.</h3>
            <p>Se ti adorano ma nessuno lo vede, hai un problema.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Recensioni vere chieste con costanza</li>
              <li>Risposte ordinate e tempestive</li>
              <li>Le cose belle che dicono di te non spariscono</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-card review-card" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="mock-top"><span>RECENSIONE GOOGLE</span><b>5.0 ★</b></div>
            <blockquote>“Serata perfetta. Panino assurdo e spritz fatto come si deve.”</blockquote>
            <div class="mock-reply"><span>Risposta</span><p>Grazie! Ci vediamo al prossimo tramonto 🍹</p></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="pillar pillar-dark">
          <div class="pillar-number">02</div>
          <div class="pillar-copy">
            <p class="kicker kicker-light">VISIBILITÀ</p>
            <h3>Fatti trovare.</h3>
            <p>Puoi essere il migliore della zona. Se quando ti cercano esce quello accanto… complimenti a lui.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Google e presenza locale tenuti vivi</li>
              <li>Recensioni che diventano segnali pubblici</li>
              <li>Contenuti che continuano a parlare di te</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-card search-card" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="search-bar">🔎 aperitivo spiaggia vicino a me</div>
            <div class="search-result active"><span>★ 4.8 · 286 recensioni</span><strong>La scelta che sembra ovvia</strong></div>
            <div class="search-result"><span>★ 4.3 · 41 recensioni</span><strong>Quello bravo che nessuno conosce</strong></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="pillar pillar-white">
          <div class="pillar-number">03</div>
          <div class="pillar-copy">
            <p class="kicker">SCELTA</p>
            <h3>Fatti scegliere.</h3>
            <p>Quando confrontano te con altri tre, devi sembrare la scelta ovvia.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Più prove reali</li>
              <li>Meno dubbi</li>
              <li>Un profilo che non sembra abbandonato da sei mesi</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-card choice-card" aria-hidden="true">
            <span>IL MOMENTO DELLA VERITÀ</span>
            <p>“Vabbè.”</p>
            <strong>“Andiamo da loro.”</strong>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="machine-section">
        <div class="shell machine-grid">
          <div>
            <p class="kicker kicker-light">IL PASSAPAROLA CHE HAI GIÀ</p>
            <h2>Messo al lavoro. ★</h2>
            <p class="machine-copy">Non inventiamo complimenti. Non compriamo recensioni. Non filtriamo chi può parlare.</p>
          </div>
          <ol class="machine-flow">
            <li><span>01</span><strong>Cliente contento</strong></li>
            <li><span>02</span><strong>Recensione</strong></li>
            <li><span>03</span><strong>Risposta</strong></li>
            <li><span>04</span><strong>Contenuto</strong></li>
            <li><span>05</span><strong>Altra fiducia</strong></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="prezzo" class="price-section shell">
        <div class="price-card">
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">UNA SOLA OFFERTA. FINE.</p>
            <h2>21 giorni per vedere<br />Trovatemi sulla tua attività.</h2>
            <p>Colleghi Google. Mettiamo in moto il flusso. Vedi cosa succede davvero.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="price-block">
            <span>Durante il trial</span>
            <strong>€0</strong>
            <small>carta richiesta all’attivazione</small>
            <hr />
            <span>Dopo 21 giorni</span>
            <strong>€149<small>/mese</small></strong>
            <small>salvo cancellazione prima della fine del trial</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="demo-section">
        <div class="shell demo-grid">
          <div>
            <p class="kicker kicker-light">DEMO FOUNDER-ASSISTED</p>
            <h2>Non ti faccio vedere slide.<br /><em>Partiamo dalla tua attività.</em></h2>
          </div>
          <div class="demo-copy">
            <p>Apriamo quello che vede oggi un cliente.</p>
            <p>Guardiamo recensioni, risposte e presenza.</p>
            <p>Poi ti faccio vedere dove Trovatemi entra in mezzo.</p>
            <strong>Se non c’è niente da sistemare, meglio per te. 😄</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="router shell">
        <p class="kicker">DA DOVE PARTIAMO?</p>
        <div class="router-grid">
          <a class="router-card router-beauty" href="/">
            <span>BEAUTY &amp; WELLNESS</span>
            <strong>Hai un salone, barber, centro estetico, nails, lashes, spa?</strong>
            <em>Fai il Beauty Check ↗</em>
          </a>
          <div class="router-card router-local">
            <span>ALTRA ATTIVITÀ LOCALE</span>
            <strong>Bar, ristorante, studio, negozio, servizio locale?</strong>
            <em>Ti mostro Trovatemi sulla tua attività.</em>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer shell">
      <div class="wordmark footer-mark">TROVATEM<span class="wordmark-i">I<span class="star">★</span></span>.IT</div>
      <p>Il passaparola che hai già. Messo al lavoro. ★</p>
      <small>H0 master-home preview · nessun nuovo prodotto · nessun nuovo prezzo</small>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #111318;
    --paper: #f5f2ea;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --yellow: #f5b301;
    --muted: #6f726f;
    --line: #1b1d22;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; background: var(--paper); }
  body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font-family: 'Archivo Variable', Arial, sans-serif; }
  a { color: inherit; }
  .shell { width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 36px)); margin-inline: auto; }
  .topbar { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20; min-height: 78px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; padding: 0 max(18px, calc((100vw - 1180px) / 2)); background: rgba(245,242,234,.96); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); }
  .wordmark { position: relative; text-decoration: none; font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 2vw, 2rem); letter-spacing: .015em; line-height: 1; }
  .wordmark-i { position: relative; }
  .star { position: absolute; right: -.35em; top: -.58em; color: var(--yellow); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: .43em; }
  nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 22px; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; }
  nav a { text-decoration: none; }
  .nav-cta { padding: 11px 14px; background: var(--ink); color: white; }
  .hero { min-height: 760px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding-block: 90px 70px; }
  .kicker { margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .kicker-light { color: var(--yellow); }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -.015em; }
  h1 { max-width: 1050px; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(4.3rem, 9.2vw, 9rem); line-height: .88; }
  h1 em, h2 em { color: var(--yellow); font-style: normal; }
  .hero-copy { max-width: 760px; margin: 34px 0 0; font-size: clamp(1.12rem, 2vw, 1.6rem); line-height: 1.45; font-weight: 600; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 34px; }
  .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 54px; padding: 0 20px; border: 2px solid var(--ink); font-weight: 900; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .button-primary { background: var(--yellow); box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--ink); }
  .button-ghost { background: transparent; }
  .offer-strip { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0; margin-top: 50px; border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .offer-strip > * { padding: 14px 18px 14px 0; margin-right: 18px; font-size: .83rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .truth-section, .machine-section, .demo-section { background: var(--ink); color: white; }
  .truth-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .65fr 1fr; gap: 60px; padding-block: 100px; }
  .truth-grid h2, .machine-grid h2, .demo-grid h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 6.5vw, 6.6rem); line-height: .92; }
  .truth-story, .truth-punch { display: grid; align-content: center; gap: 8px; }
  .truth-story p, .truth-punch p { margin: 0; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .truth-story strong, .truth-punch strong { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 1.35rem; color: var(--yellow); }
  .pillars { padding-block: 110px; }
  .section-head { margin-bottom: 56px; }
  .section-head h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(3.6rem, 7.4vw, 7.4rem); line-height: .9; }
  .pillar { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr 1fr; gap: 42px; align-items: center; min-height: 470px; margin-block: 24px; padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 54px); border: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .pillar-yellow { background: var(--yellow); }
  .pillar-dark { background: var(--ink); color: white; }
  .pillar-white { background: white; }
  .pillar-number { align-self: start; font-family: Anton, sans-serif; font-size: 4rem; line-height: 1; opacity: .28; }
  .pillar h3 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem); line-height: .92; }
  .pillar-copy > p:not(.kicker) { max-width: 520px; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; }
  .pillar ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .mock-card { min-height: 300px; border: 2px solid currentColor; background: white; color: var(--ink); box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 currentColor; padding: 24px; }
  .pillar-dark .mock-card { box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--yellow); }
  .mock-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 18px; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 900; }
  .review-card blockquote { margin: 34px 0; font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 800; }
  .mock-reply { padding: 16px; background: #f1f1ed; }
  .mock-reply span { font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .mock-reply p { margin: 8px 0 0; }
  .search-card { display: grid; align-content: start; gap: 14px; }
  .search-bar { padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 999px; font-size: .9rem; }
  .search-result { display: grid; gap: 7px; padding: 18px; border: 1px solid #ddd; }
  .search-result.active { border: 3px solid var(--yellow); }
  .search-result span { font-size: .76rem; color: #6a6a6a; }
  .search-result strong { font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .choice-card { display: grid; place-content: center; text-align: center; }
  .choice-card span { font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .choice-card p { margin: 28px 0 0; font-family: Anton, sans-serif; font-size: 4rem; line-height: 1; }
  .choice-card strong { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 1.55rem; }
  .machine-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: start; padding-block: 100px; }
  .machine-copy { max-width: 540px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.72); font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .machine-flow { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25); }
  .machine-flow li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50px 1fr; gap: 16px; padding: 18px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25); }
  .machine-flow span { color: var(--yellow); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 900; }
  .machine-flow strong { font-size: 1.25rem; }
  .price-section { padding-block: 110px; }
  .price-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .8fr; gap: 70px; align-items: center; padding: clamp(30px, 5vw, 64px); background: var(--yellow); border: 2px solid var(--ink); box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 var(--ink); }
  .price-card h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 6vw, 6.4rem); line-height: .92; }
  .price-card > div > p:not(.kicker) { max-width: 600px; font-size: 1.12rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; }
  .price-block { display: grid; gap: 8px; padding: 28px; background: var(--ink); color: white; }
  .price-block > span { color: var(--yellow); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .price-block > strong { font-family: Anton, sans-serif; font-size: 5.5rem; line-height: 1; }
  .price-block strong small { font-family: 'Archivo Variable', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; }
  .price-block > small { color: rgba(255,255,255,.68); line-height: 1.4; }
  .price-block hr { width: 100%; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25); margin: 16px 0; }
  .demo-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; padding-block: 100px; }
  .demo-copy { display: grid; align-content: center; gap: 9px; }
  .demo-copy p { margin: 0; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .demo-copy strong { margin-top: 18px; color: var(--yellow); font-size: 1.3rem; }
  .router { padding-block: 100px; }
  .router-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }
  .router-card { min-height: 280px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: 34px; border: 2px solid var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
  .router-card span { font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .router-card strong { max-width: 500px; font-family: Anton, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 4rem); line-height: .98; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .router-card em { font-style: normal; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .router-beauty { background: #ff5d87; }
  .router-local { background: white; }
  .footer { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; padding-block: 48px; border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .footer p { margin: 0; align-self: center; font-weight: 800; }
  .footer small { grid-column: 1 / -1; color: var(--muted); }
  .footer-mark { text-decoration: none; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    nav a:not(.nav-cta) { display: none; }
    .hero { min-height: auto; padding-block: 72px 50px; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(4rem, 17vw, 7rem); }
    .truth-grid, .machine-grid, .demo-grid, .price-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 38px; }
    .pillar { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 26px; }
    .pillar-number { font-size: 2.8rem; }
    .mock-card { min-height: 250px; }
    .router-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .shell { width: min(100% - 24px, 1180px); }
    .topbar { min-height: 68px; padding-inline: 12px; }
    .wordmark { font-size: 1.35rem; }
    .nav-cta { padding: 10px; font-size: .66rem; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(3.7rem, 18vw, 5.6rem); }
    .hero-copy { font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .hero-actions { flex-direction: column; }
    .button { width: 100%; }
    .offer-strip > * { width: 50%; margin: 0; padding-right: 8px; }
    .truth-grid, .machine-grid, .demo-grid { padding-block: 72px; }
    .pillars, .price-section, .router { padding-block: 72px; }
    .section-head h2, .truth-grid h2, .machine-grid h2, .demo-grid h2, .price-card h2 { font-size: clamp(3.1rem, 15vw, 5rem); }
    .pillar { padding: 24px; min-height: 0; }
    .pillar h3 { font-size: 3.2rem; }
    .mock-card { box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 currentColor; padding: 18px; }
    .price-block > strong { font-size: 4.2rem; }
    .footer { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .footer small { grid-column: auto; }
  }
</style>
